// Two namespaces that agree for the first 510 characters and differ only in
// their final segment.
//
// The namespace path was assembled by snprintf-ing each `::` segment onto a
// `char buf[512]`, in both the `namespace` declaration and the `from` clause.
// Past the cap the trailing segment was clipped away, so these two distinct
// namespaces mangled to one name and their same-named `cfg` modules merged —
// silently, since both `from` clauses clipped to the same prefix and therefore
// still resolved to it. Both halves are now sized to the path.
namespace nspre_::aaa::

module cfg =
    let v = 1
